    {
      "source": "Encode from an <code>Object</code> stream to a byte stream of Smile objects using Jackson 2.x.\nFor non-streaming use cases, <code>Flux</code> elements are collected into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>\nbefore serialization for performance reason.",
      "translation": "使用 Jackson 2.x 从 `<code>Object`</code> 流编码为 Smile 对象的字节流。对于非流式用例，出于性能考虑，在序列化之前会将 `<code>Flux</code>` 元素收集到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 中。",
